OL,3,GNEWSARewilding sessions help us feel
OL,4,Acalmer, children say
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren in East Sussex have described
OL,7,Ftheir outdoor rewilding sessions as
OL,8,Fhelping them to feel calmer.
OL,10,FProject Rewild, which receives support
OL,11,Ffrom BBC Children in Need, is based in
OL,12,FHastings and offers children the
OL,13,Fopportunity to connect with the natural
OL,14,Fworld, whatever the weather, during
OL,15,Fhalf-term.
OL,17,FGeorge, one of the youngsters taking
OL,18,Fpart, told BBC South East: "It's about
OL,19,Fbeing outside, making friends and
OL,20,Fenjoying the nature.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
